ones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. Una de ellas, Sjrr Power Peaking Facility, presentó el informe 447643 por una emisión que empezó el 2025-10-17 y que, según el informe, siguió hasta el 2025-11-15 23:00, hora local, pero el informe no incluye 1,3-butadieno, así que no corresponde a esta lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar qué causó esta lectura de 1,3-butadieno.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0307_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88649,"sha256":"0a17f200bfc5578973f8861ebafc67558bbe6d4e401f1cf1925822be0bbdbec1","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:11+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0057_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0057","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88034,"sha256":"25c2cf6eb93814b3ba415f246fca5eb5304c964cec008621d793ef6ff36646ea","fetched